Several accounts in God’s Word show that his loyal servants knew that there would be a resurrection in the future.
Jehovah said: “Take, please, your son, your only son whom you so love, Isaac, and travel to the land of Moriah and offer him up there as a burnt offering. ” How do you think Abraham felt when he heard this command?
Jehovah had promised that through Abraham’s descendants all nations would be blessed. Also, Jehovah said that the blessing would come “through Isaac. ”
